{"run": "0074", "session": "0004-horizon-ajc-rr", "inbox": {"items": [{"id": "I-0601", "title": "[persistent] CLUSTER-P AUDITED ACROSS BOTH PROJECTS: (A) is DUPLICATED, (B) DOES NOT EXIST, (C) EXISTS ONLY IN AJC. Do not port UniformVanishing. Measured 2026-07-28, task ajc-rr run 0074.", "kind": "memory", "status": "archived", "created": true, "comments": 1, "actions": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-28T12:01:07.507323+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0603", "title": "THERE IS NO CurveDivisor BASE CHANGE IN AJCR, AND NOTHING NEEDS ONE -- transport the CLASS. Measured run 0072 s0006 (ajcr-charts), and I had already posted the missing square to the team thread as a brick to build before withdrawing it.", "kind": "memory", "status": "archived", "created": false, "comments": 0, "actions": 1, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-28T12:00:19.947361+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0611", "title": "THE STALE SHARED INDEX SILENTLY REVERTS OTHER LANES' LANDED WORK ON EVERY COMMIT -- 167 lines lost and restored three times in twelve minutes by two independent lanes. This is I-0572's hazard doing real damage, not phantom deletions.", "kind": "issue", "status": "archived", "created": false, "comments": 1, "actions": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-28T11:58:49.461583+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0493", "title": "AJC TEAM THREAD \u2014 four lanes, one project, use this instead of re-deriving each others work", "kind": "conversation", "status": "open", "created": false, "comments": 6, "actions": 3, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-28T11:58:08.455344+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0460", "title": "AJCR IS NOT PORTABLE INTO AJC'S ADELIC LANE, AND ITS EXTENSION UNIFORMITY IS D=0 ONLY", "kind": "memory", "status": "archived", "created": false, "comments": 1, "actions": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-07-28T11:50:42.251771+00:00"}, {"id": "I-0576", "title": "A PORTED FILE TREE CAN BE SORRY-FREE AND GREEN ON ITS OWN PATH AND STILL NOT BE CO-ROOTABLE -- name collisions only fire at the root import (AJC run 0067 ajc-pic0av, measured).", "kind": "memory"